{"id":"vod_sn_36244","vodId":"36244","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"刀语","name_cn":"刀语","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/b1208a9d4ec91bf3a035cf6bf8f236e5.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在中世纪的日本，鑢七花（细谷佳正 配音）是一个外表强壮头脑简单的男子，生于武术世家的他背负着传承“虚刀流”的重任。从小到大，鑢七花便被当做一把刀来培养，这种变态的教育方式使得他最终走上了弑亲的悲剧道路。在奇策士咎儿（田村由加利 配音）的鼓动和怂恿下，鑢七花踏上了漫漫的修炼之路，他要找到锻制师四季崎记纪（森功至 配音）所锻造的12把名刀，来增强自己的实力。　　一路上，鑢七花遇上了各式各样的敌人，别无选择的他只得一一将他们斩杀。然而，当身边的亲人和朋友接连死去的时候，愚钝的鑢七花开始思考起作为一把刀的价值和意义。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:33","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PwuzqY5ExM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DstKqjwvCX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1AsdESunen1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/e7b2kBT5qa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tG42f4XKLR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HtaxHEqW241/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/X0ftYDRAfH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HGihN5nPLd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qtVHzP06q91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AGdQqHyg4G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Hui6g980421/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HuXMawQ6C21/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:25.065Z"}